    description: 'Turbo edition of Dot Connect: identical mechanics, 35% more speed, its own leaderboard. Every colour appears twice; drag a path from one dot to its partner. Paths cannot cross, so routing one carelessly blocks the next — and drawing over an existing line simply erases it, which makes the real puzzle finding the order to connect them in. The trick is to stop reacting to individual threats and start reading the pattern a beat ahead — the original taught you the pattern, this one tests whether you learned it.',
